flowchart LR
  A["Sourced theorem<br/>paper, book, or original result"] --> B["Lemma packet<br/>plain English + LaTeX + Lean draft"]
  B --> C["Public proposal<br/>scope, provenance, and credit"]
  C --> D["Mathematical review<br/>statement and assumptions"]
  D --> E["Lean review<br/>imports, namespace, API, proof"]
  E --> F["Project gate<br/>library + tests + site checks"]
  F --> G["Integrated declaration<br/>catalog + teaching page"]
  D -->|"revision requested"| B
  E -->|"diagnostics or API changes"| B
  G --> H["Future Research IDE<br/>reuse and propose the next lemma"]
  H --> B

  classDef source fill:#e7ebf7,stroke:#4d5e8d,color:#18252d
  classDef review fill:#fff0c7,stroke:#875b00,color:#18252d
  classDef verified fill:#dff4e8,stroke:#176b43,color:#18252d
  class A,B,C source
  class D,E review
  class F,G,H verified
